<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">Tagin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 Jon</para>
  <para style="toc1">JON gv Siti Lvnyinvbv jinam</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Jon</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Jn</para>
  <para style="mt1">JON</para>
  <para style="mt2">gv Siti Lvnyinvbv Jinam</para>
  <para style="imt">Mintamchonam</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Jon gv siti Lvnyinvbv lwknam si</char> “Nyigagatv” vdwgv lokv “aya minsunam dvnvbvyu vdwa okv bunugv umvuu vdwa”, lvkto, soogv si atubogv gvrja vdwa okv oogv nyi vdwa lvkto. Soogv mvnggap dubv doin miuu lwknam angv si ajin anyingnga alvbv pakmi sitoka vla mindunv okv tamsar sarmurnv vdwa okv bunugv sarmur nama gamrwpvla ritoku.</para>
  <para style="iot">Arwng lokv darlinnam</para>
  <para style="io1">Mintamchonam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:1-3">1-3</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paknam gv kolv ngv <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:4-6">4-6</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mvvnam doin am gamrwnam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:7-11">7-11</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Minyungminya <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:12-13">12-13</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1"/>Abwng Jon lokv—</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2JN 1:1">Ayanam dvnvbuyu okv bunugv umvuu vdwa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Dvnvmvtv okv bunugv umvuu vdwa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Si gvrja akonyi minchar jidu okv oogv doonv vdwaka (verse 4,5 loka doodu).</char></note> okv ngoogv jvjvrungbv paknam. Okv ngo akin twkma, vbvritola yvvdw jvjvnga chinv vdwv mvnwng ngv nonua pakdu, <verse eid="2JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2"/>ogulvgavbolo jvjvngv ngonu gvlo doodunv okv ngonu gvlo dvbvsingtambv doobvre. <verse eid="2JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3"/>Pwknvyarnv Abu, okv Abu gv kuunyilo Jisu Kristo, ngonua anyuaya, aya okv sarsopoyo nga jinamv doyi laka; okv jvjv okv paknamv bunu ngonu gvbv doolwk yilaka.<verse eid="2JN 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jvjv okv Paknamv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4"/>Abu gv ngonua gamkinam aingbv, nonugv umvuu meegonv jvjvlo ridubv tvvpa nam lvgabv vdwgo ngo himpu siyato. <verse eid="2JN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:12">15:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref> </char></note> Okv vbvrikunamv, ayasinam dvnvbvyu: kaju ngonu mvnwng ngv ajin anyingnga pakmisila juka. Ngoogv nonua lvkdung dunam si anwnv gamki yagoma; si ngonu gvlo klu lokv gamki la doobwng kunam go. <verse eid="2JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6"/>Ngoogv pakmi sidubv mindunv si ngonu Pwknvyarnv gv gamki kolo tvvla doorung tvlaka vnamgo. Klu lokv, nonu mvnwng gv tvvnam gamki si, nonu mvnwng ngv pakmi sinam lo dooto laka vnamgo.<verse eid="2JN 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7"/>Nyiamooku so nyi meego mvvnv ngv vnglin doku, oogv nyi vdwv Jisu Kristonyi nyiamooku so nyi nyidung bv aapvnv vla mimanv, oogv nyi mvvnv ngv okv Kristo gv Nyimak bv rinv ngv. <verse eid="2JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8"/>Vbvrikunamv ngonu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ngonugv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kvvgonv Kitap lo; </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nonu. </char></note> ogunv kudungkua ripvnam ngv nyema nam lvgabv, nonu awv hinggu sula dooto laka, vbvribolo nonugv Amen am paareku.<verse eid="2JN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9"/>Yvvdw Jisu Kristo gv tamsar kolo dooma dunv, vbvritola, ribovngbo yadunv vv Pwknvyarnv gvlo paaya mare. Yvvdw so tamsar kolo doodudw vv Abu nyila okv Kuunyilo anyibabwng nga paare. <verse eid="2JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10"/>Vbvrinamv, yvvdw nonu gvlo aadula soogv tamsarnam sum aagv la aama dubolo, um nonugv naam lo aadu bv ninyia kumrwklvtak siyoka; “Nonu gvlo sarsopoyo namv doyilakv vla vbvka miyoka.” <verse eid="2JN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11"/>Holvgabv yvvdw bunua sarsopoyo nga nonu lvkobv doyilakv vla mindunv, kokwnglo bunugv alvmanv gv rinam lo ajin gobv ridunv.<verse eid="2JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minyungminya gamchar vdwv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12"/>Ngo nonua minsv meego doodunv, vbvrijvka pvta soka okv sai lokv lvkmare; vbvmayabv, ngo awv kaalwkla okv gaam yangv mirwksiya nvpv mvngla mvngtindu, vbvribolo, ngonugv mvngpuv pumichiki yariku.<verse eid="2JN 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13"/>Nonugv ayanam anyibormv vdwgv umvuu vdwv <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">anyibormv vdwgv umvuu vdwv: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soogv si oogv gvrja lo doonv vdwa oogv lvknv vdwa minchar jidu.</char></note> bunugv kumrwksinam go jilwk dunv.<verse eid="2JN 1:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1"/>
</usx>
